  "title": "Steering behaviors: seek, flee, arrive, pursue, evade, wander",
  "purpose": "Compute Reynolds-style steering forces for 2D agents (seek, flee with a panic distance, arrive with a slowing radius, pursue and evade with prediction, seeded wander) and integrate a point mass with force and speed limits.",
